validator survived under PID 1. Revalidation now uses an isolated `Popen` child
and the same descendant-tree reaper as UAT, so runner cleanup cannot return
while a revalidation descendant is still active. Unit regressions cover managed
revalidation success, failure, drift, and interruption.

